ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/d70cca0121fc14b7019bb41b22f717a217089cc0/ss_d70cca0121fc14b7019bb41b22f717a217089cc0.600x338.jpg?t=1770392503"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/45b2fd9c4933551fb5a2a32c7f4387643e0c393c/ss_45b2fd9c4933551fb5a2a32c7f4387643e0c393c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770392503","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/45b2fd9c4933551fb5a2a32c7f4387643e0c393c/ss_45b2fd9c4933551fb5a2a32c7f4387643e0c393c.600x338.jpg?t=1770392503"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/c026b5a79fb430674963fa2cf93a032b5d9be444/ss_c026b5a79fb430674963fa2cf93a032b5d9be444.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770392503","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/c026b5a79fb430674963fa2cf93a032b5d9be444/ss_c026b5a79fb430674963fa2cf93a032b5d9be444.600x338.jpg?t=1770392503"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/66ec718b551e0927fb037aa32580a040446172f0/ss_66ec718b551e0927fb037aa32580a040446172f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770392503","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/66ec718b551e0927fb037aa32580a040446172f0/ss_66ec718b551e0927fb037aa32580a040446172f0.600x338.jpg?t=1770392503"}],"short_description":"Your family is gone, but the trail isn't cold. Hunt their abductor through shifting, ritual-scarred locations in this co-op detective horror. Solve puzzles, banish spirits, and find the truth. But stay sharp\u2014your family might not want to be saved. Your choices, your destiny.","steam_appid":3706150,"support_info":{"email":"sumostudio.help@gmail.com","url":"https://discord.gg/5zPJcp8zHQ"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://discord.gg/5zPJcp8zHQ"}